Package: mytag
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-mutagen, python3-pil, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4)
Maintainer: Miguel Angel Esteban <noreply@example.com>
Homepage: https://maestebanc.github.io/MyTag/
Description: Edit tags and cover art on your music files
 MyTag is a simple, focused tag and cover art editor for music files
 files on Linux. Load a file or a whole folder of albums at once,
 edit as many tracks together as you like, and search for cover art
 online (MusicBrainz and iTunes) without leaving the app.
 .
 This package targets Debian/Ubuntu releases with GTK4 >= 4.10 and
 Libadwaita >= 1.4 (e.g. Ubuntu 24.04+ or Debian trixie+).
